      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780512654752,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. User logs in and opens the control screen.\n2. The app calls the Node.js API (auth, CRUD, device control).\n3. For physical devices, the API forwards an HTTP command to the Pico W.\n4. The Pico W toggles the LED and rotates the servo (curtain/door), reporting state back as JSON.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User logs in and opens the control screen.\n2. The app calls the Node.js API (auth, CRUD, device control).\n3. For physical devices, the API forwards an HTTP command to the Pico W.\n4. The Pico W toggles the LED and rotates the servo (curtain/door), reporting state back as JSON.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 92,
      "index": "aB",
      "autoResize": true
    }
